<title>HONG KONG: ING Barings sets China Resources warrants.</title>
<headline>ING Barings sets China Resources warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Baring Financial Products said on Tuesday it proposed to launch 220 million American-style call warrants linked to China Resources Enterprise Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrant control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$13.32     PREMIUM	   15.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.3818    GEARING	   3.86X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	10.DEC.97    PAYDATE	   2 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT  HK$14.80     MIN EXER LOT    20,000</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG    GOVERNING LAW   HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
